    {
      "id": 5220,
      "name": "Spiff",
      "username": "Spiff",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2011-09-26T15:35:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Given the fact that most people seem to think that any new environments which are introduced to the game should be as widely-applicable as possible (see here: <a href=\"http://greaterthangames.info/forum/index.php/topic,148.0.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://greaterthangames.info/forum/index.php/topic,148.0.html</a>), then how many of these generic environments (i.e. you can picture fighting just about any villain there) can we think up?</p>\n<p>Keep in mind that if any of these actually appear in future expansions, it’s because the &gt;Games guys had already thought them up, not that they got the idea from here, so their lawyers don’t need to worry. <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"></p>\n<p>I’ll start:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Underground Cave Complex</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>cave-ins</li>\n<li>mole people</li>\n<li>blind cave creatures</li>\n<li>mysterious underground lake</li>\n<li>lava flows</li>\n<li>etc.</li>\n</ul>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>Time Travel Vortex</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>mammoths</li>\n<li>pirates</li>\n<li>WWII soldiers</li>\n<li>future cops</li>\n<li>bi-planes</li>\n<li>time swirls and chrono flows</li>\n<li>etc.</li>\n</ul>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>Arctic Base</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>whiteouts/snowblindness</li>\n<li>frostbite</li>\n<li>crevasses</li>\n<li>avalanches</li>\n<li>wendigo/yeti monsters</li>\n<li>automated base defenses</li>\n<li>various domes within the base (power, biodome, research, etc.)</li>\n<li>etc.</li>\n</ul>\n<ol start=\"4\">\n<li>Area 51</li>\n</ol>\n<ul>\n<li>all the zany alien stuff you’d expect to find in Area 51</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Anyone else got ideas?</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:34:48.614Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
