      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/5e9695/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-09-27T14:46:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It’d be neat to play in a sort of alt-universe version of Megaopolis. Say like the heroes go to a different dimension in the multiverse, and Megaopolis is a dirty, shady city run by crime lords.<br>\nAnother neat thing would be another base like the Mars base, but have this one just be in the sky. A floating airforce base, perhaps.</p>",
