      "created_at": "2011-09-28T18:35:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Here’s another one, which may actually be kind of likely given the hints we’ve seen… <a href=\"http://greaterthangames.info/forum/index.php/topic,122.0.html\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">http://greaterthangames.info/forum/index.php/topic,122.0.html</a>.</p>\n<p>Massive Sewer Complex</p>\n<ul>\n<li>giant crocodiles (natch)</li>\n<li>noxious fumes (weakens combatants the longer the card is in play)</li>\n<li>methane build up (any fire damage makes them explode)</li>\n<li>Morlock-style underground dwelling mutants</li>\n<li>lost in the maze!</li>\n<li>close quarters fighting</li>\n<li>come up for air</li>\n<li>pipes burst!</li>\n</ul>",
