      "raw": "Here's another one, which may actually be kind of likely given the hints we've seen... http://greaterthangames.info/forum/index.php/topic,122.0.html.\n\nMassive Sewer Complex\n - giant crocodiles (natch)\n - noxious fumes (weakens combatants the longer the card is in play)\n - methane build up (any fire damage makes them explode)\n - Morlock-style underground dwelling mutants\n - lost in the maze!\n - close quarters fighting\n - come up for air\n - pipes burst!",
