      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/e0b2c6/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-10-08T03:12:45.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Space station</p>\n<ul>\n<li>AI, both helpful and rogue (perhaps enhanced by omnitron)</li>\n<li>zero gravity - melee and projectile attacks also injure the attacker</li>\n<li>pure oxygen - all healing increased by 1, fire attacks damage all hero cards</li>\n<li>sucked into the vacuum - hero with fewest cards in play is unable to use powers or play cards, and is damaged an increasing amount every turn (1 then 2 then 3, etc). Other players can save them by destroying their own cards - initially needing to destroy a lot, decreasing every turn.</li>\n<li>faulty filtration - heroes take toxic damage every turn (cancelled by pure oxygen and vice versa)</li>\n</ul>",
      "post_number": 6,
